      "value": "Totally agree but unfortunately your idea won't work as well as this one: https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/add-a-stealth-mode-to-allow-people-to-appear-offline People can easily bypass by joining the instance directly (instead of the player), so appearing offline/invisible would be ideal.\nI've wanted this for years too but it looks like the VRC staff is ignoring/avoiding anything to do with user privacy, despite the very positive user response. :( If a competitor game comes along with this and other similar features, so long VRC, survival of the fittest: either listen to your fans or step down.",
