      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5adfcb2a44b24b6ef7cb11ec|full_name}: Sorry for the late reply! Offline statuses would logically prevent all joins unless the person happens to get lucky and join your same instance.\nLet me put it like this. Now and again I want to go meet some new people without having a bunch of my existing friends want to pile in on the room and expect me to pay attention to them. The way VRchat is set up right now is like having a phone with no way to mute or turn off the ringer. Imagine trying to carry a serious conversation with someone while your friends are calling you every 5 minutes, and having to tell each one that you'll call them back later. An offline status is the same thing; it's a feature existing on practically every social platform and it's very important.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
