      "value": "@{5c36eedb1d13162b96f411ef|full_name}: Setting your status to Busy automatically turns down any invites or invite requests, so the phone ringer comparison is solved there. It sounds more like you're annoyed that you can't walk around in public without your friends seeing you. Issue is, it's a public world. If they join on you with a busy status, I think it's more of an issue of them wanting to see you regardless. To fix your comparison: It's like walking outside your house and a friend of yours sees you and runs over. I believe your issue is pretty niche at this point.",
      "viewerReactions": null
